{
  "lib": "cli",
  "description": "utopia-php/cli: command-line applications. A CLI parses `<command> --key=value` arguments, matches a Task, resolves its params (validated, booleans coerced) and injected resources from a container, and runs it between init and shutdown hooks; failures go to error hooks. Adapters run the work once (Generic) or in a worker pool (Swoole).",
  "complete": true,
  "php": {
    "src": [
      "packages/cli/src"
    ],
    "tests": [
      "packages/cli/tests"
    ]
  },
  "rust": {
    "crate": "crates/utopia/cli"
  },
  "services": [],
  "state": [],
  "ops": {
    "cli.run": {
      "doc": "new CLI(new Generic(), argv, container?) (argv, or ['app', command, ...arguments] when `command` is given) (a parent container holding `container`), driven by `steps`, each {name: argument}: task {name, id, desc, groups, labels, params (each {key, default, validator (see http.run's validators; {factory: spec} for a callable), description, optional, injections, skip_validation, aliases}), inject, fail {message, code}}, bare_task name (a task without a callback, its getName()), init|shutdown|error (the same without name), set_resource {name, value, dependencies, counter}, resource name, resources [names], reset, set_container {name: value}, has name (getContainer()->has()), tasks ([getName, getDesc] of getTasks()), task_keys, args (getArgs()), match (match()?->getName()), parse argv, run. Callbacks record [id, the named arguments they got] (exceptions as {$exception: {class, message, code}}) and throw `fail`; run returns the calls and the exception run() let out. Each step's result ({\"$error\": {class, message, code}} when it throws); a CLI that cannot be built is [its error]",
      "covers": [
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::__construct",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::init",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::shutdown",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::error",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::task",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::getResource",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::getResources",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::setResource",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::getContainer",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::setContainer",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::reset",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::parse",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::match",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::run",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::getTasks",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\CLI::getArgs",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Task::getName"
      ],
      "fuzz": [
        {
          "name": "parse",
          "args": {
            "gen": "object",
            "fields": {
              "argv": {
                "gen": "ref",
                "name": "argv"
              },
              "steps": {
                "gen": "const",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "args": true
                  },
                  {
                    "match": true
                  },
                  {
                    "parse": [
                      "x",
                      "deploy",
                      "--a=1",
                      "--a",
                      "--b=c=d"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "args": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "iterations": 2000
        },
        {
          "name": "run",
          "args": {
            "gen": "object",
            "fields": {
              "command": {
                "gen": "pick",
                "from": [
                  "build",
                  "deploy",
                  "other"
                ]
              },
              "arguments": {
                "gen": "array",
                "items": {
                  "gen": "ref",
                  "name": "arg"
                },
                "min": 0,
                "max": 6
              },
              "container": {
                "gen": "const",
                "value": {
                  "base": "from-parent",
                  "db": "parent-db"
                }
              },
              "steps": {
                "gen": "array",
                "items": {
                  "gen": "ref",
                  "name": "step"
                },
                "min": 1,
                "max": 8
              }
            },
            "optional": [
              "container"
            ]
          },
          "iterations": 3000
        }
      ]
    },
    "task.run": {
      "doc": "new Task(name) configured and read by `steps`: desc, label {key, value}, param (as cli.run's), inject, action; get name|desc|params (keys)|dependencies|action (calls it with call_user_func_array, as CLI::run() does); label_of {key, default}. Each step's result ({\"$error\": ...} when it throws)",
      "covers": [
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Task::__construct",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Task::getName"
      ]
    },
    "generic.run": {
      "doc": "new Generic() driven by `steps`: workers ($workerNum), start, stop, on_worker_start, on_worker_stop, on_job, each with a callback recording its name and arguments. Returns each step's result (true when the method returns the adapter) and the calls",
      "covers": [
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Adapter::__construct",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Adapters\\Generic::start",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Adapters\\Generic::stop",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Adapters\\Generic::onWorkerStart",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Adapters\\Generic::onWorkerStop",
        "Utopia\\CLI\\Adapters\\Generic::onJob"
      ],
      "fuzz": [
        {
          "name": "steps",
          "args": {
            "gen": "object",
            "fields": {
              "steps": {
                "gen": "array",
                "items": {
                  "gen": "pick",
                  "from": [
                    "workers",
                    "start",
                    "stop",
                    "on_worker_start",
                    "on_worker_stop",
                    "on_job"
                  ]
                },
                "min": 1,
                "max": 8
              }
            }
          },
          "iterations": 300
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "generators": {
